<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG Electronics 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>LG Electronics 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				    700    vs   880</p>
<p>    Net					     64.84 vs    79.22</p>
<p>    Turnover				   7,502.45 vs 6,591.71</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	common shares				4    vs  6</p>
<p>	preferred shares			   5    vs  7</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   78.84 vs 94.90</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		    (gain) 65.97 vs 17.89 (loss)</p>
<p>    Div Register				     Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Pay					  March 24</p>
<p>Note - LG Electronics Inc, a unit of the LG Group, is South Korea's leading consumer electronics and home appliance maker.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
